{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年49歲的鍾麗淇（Margaret）9月因健康問題，被緊急送往香港中文大學醫院深切治療部（ICU）留醫，目前仍在留院中。</p><p>自她被送入院以來，好姐妹「七魔女」近乎每日輪流到醫院探望，好感情感動一眾網友。</p><p>適逢鍾麗淇細女Michela迎來11歲生</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T03:35:01.063744+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T02:27:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T03:28:21.517740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T03:28:21.517740+00:00","content_hash":"cab2aee2d614df61ba87f43dda35a05f4fb93a08914a0658967561fc06a792bb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}